1
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,440
Dear,

2
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,720
you've finally arrived.

3
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,440
Sorry, Mr. Zhuang,

4
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:28,600
I'm late.

5
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,160
We finally meet.

6
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,480
You've been back for so long,

7
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:37,480
yet you never contacted me.

8
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,760
I thought you forgot your old friend.

9
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:41,360
Mr. Zhuang, you're too kind.

10
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,120
You've been following the news.

11
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:44,920
I've been too busy to get away.

12
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:48,200
You're starting to look like a real wife.

13
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,600
You're still way ahead of me.

14
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,360
Time doesn't fade a beauty.

15
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,520
You still have

16
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:53,640
a way with words.

17
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,360
What a coincidence.

18
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:55,960
Look,

19
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,600
someone you know is here too.

20
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:00,960
Jiang Li.

21
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:02,480
Mr. Zhou.

22
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,320
I thought you were in Fan State on a business trip.

23
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:06,760
Yeah.

24
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,000
But

25
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:09,560
the plan changed,

26
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:10,560
and I heard

27
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,600
Mr. Zhuang is here too,

28
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:12,680
so I came to visit.

29
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,480
Ms. Jiang,

30
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,040
we meet again.

31
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:22,520
Mr. Shen,

32
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:24,120
we really are fated to meet.

33
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:33,000
It turns out that

34
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,080
we are all acquaintances.

35
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,360
It seems that tonight

36
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,920
we really need to have a good drink.

37
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:40,680
Please.

38
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,440
Can Jiang Li really find out?

39
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,560
If she finds out,

40
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,120
how should I deal with that woman?

41
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,400
Honey,

42
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:12,280
I've been waiting for you in the bedroom for a long time.

43
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:18,360
I'll come in after I finish my work.

44
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,120
Okay?

45
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,240
Su...

46
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,960
Muchen.

47
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,600
Purple vine.

48
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,480
By the way,

49
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,240
when I accompanied the old man to France

50
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,760
to visit Charles,

51
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,800
I saw this girl's design draft,

52
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,120
and knew she was not an ordinary person.

53
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,640
Now she has become the chief designer of Golden Thread.

54
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:09,880
Your foresight

55
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,840
is indeed sharp.

56
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:11,880
Back then,

57
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,080
grandpa was against it,

58
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,320
but you

59
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,040
insisted on investing.

60
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,400
Now it seems

61
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,000
it was indeed a wise choice.

62
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,480
It's a pity

63
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,920
that Annie is too cautious.

64
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:23,640
I've tried to increase my shareholding many times,

65
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,920
but she always rejected it.

66
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,720
When the company goes public,

67
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:29,080
everyone here will have a chance to benefit.

68
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:30,640
The golden age of Golden Thread

69
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,760
has just begun.

70
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:32,720
Oh,

71
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:35,120
then at that time,

72
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,080
I will definitely increase my shareholding.

73
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,000
After all,

74
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,600
who wouldn't want to take a bite

75
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,960
of such tender lamb?

76
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,080
If that's the case,

77
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,280
why did you

78
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,880
reject the proposal

79
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,760
for limited release of Dark Fairy Tale?

80
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:49,600
After all,

81
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,120
I don't have a solid foundation

82
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,440
at Golden Thread.

83
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:57,280
I have to go with the majority.

84
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,320
Although I'm the biggest shareholder

85
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,880
besides the Lu family,

86
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:02,560
I only hold

87
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,720
10% of the shares.

88
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,880
Compared to the 80% held by the Lu family,

89
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:08,440
it's not worth mentioning.

90
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,440
What if

91
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:12,280
Mr. Zhou and I become your foundation?

92
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:15,160
Would you still go with the majority?

93
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:16,880
Jiang Li.

94
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:21,800
Leave it to me.

95
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,480
Oh?

96
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:26,720
Let's hear it.

97
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,360
The son-in-law of the Lu family,

98
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:31,840
and the future daughter-in-law.

99
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,480
We are both Lu family members

100
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:35,200
and not Lu family members.

101
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,280
If you can offer enough benefits,

102
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,520
we can provide equivalent chips.

103
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,200
What do you think

104
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,640
of this deal, Mr. Zhuang?

105
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,880
I was right about you.

106
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,440
Your words are bold.

107
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,680
Don't you think, Mr. Zhou?

108
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:56,440
Come on.

109
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,080
It hurts.

110
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,520
Are you crazy?

111
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,120
Saying those things to Zhuang Wan?

112
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,200
Do you like me?

113
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,600
I'm your brother-in-law.

114
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,680
You're Lu Xu's fiancée.

115
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:26,880
Let's stop here.

116
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,560
You lied to Lu Qianqian,

117
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:31,720
to Lu Xu,

118
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:34,240
and now you're lying to yourself.

119
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,280
Do you really love her?

120
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,080
Just like you did back then.

121
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,520
Did Lu Xu ask you to seduce me?

122
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,240
Yes.

123
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,640
He asked me to seduce you.

124
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:55,120
But so what?

125
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,400
Fate brought us together again.

126
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,240
Even if it's a bad relationship, it's still a relationship, isn't it?

127
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:02,120
Do you really love Lu Qianqian?

128
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,520
Or I'll put it another way.

129
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,320
If you and Lu Qianqian switch identities,

130
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,560
will you still love her?

131
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,000
If there were no Lu Xu,

132
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,320
and I met you again,

133
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,760
I would still do this.

134
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:17,040
Because we are both

135
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,360
weeds climbing up through thorns.

136
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:21,840
If there's a chance,

137
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,000
don't you want to

138
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:26,160
step on people like Lu Xu and Lu Qianqian?

139
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,200
I do.

140
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:39,720
So, are you willing to join me?

141
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:51,800
Aren't you afraid

142
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:55,120
I'm just using you?

143
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,360
I'll ask you one last time.

144
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,840
Do you like me?

145
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,480
Answer it.

146
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:36,600
Hello, Mr. Xu.

147
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:37,280
Zhou.

148
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,640
I heard you're in Binhai.

149
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,000
What a coincidence!

150
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,280
Mr. Guo, whom you've been trying to meet,

151
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,080
is with me right now.

152
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:43,680
I'll send you an address.

153
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:44,200
Come over quickly.

154
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:44,560
Mr. Xu,

155
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,680
it's too late today.

156
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:46,760
Maybe another day.

157
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:47,640
No,

158
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,200
Mr. Guo is leaving for the US tomorrow.

159
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,880
Dark Fairy Tale needs your overseas media resources.

160
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:53,200
It'll be hard to meet him

161
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:53,920
after he leaves.

162
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:58,760
I'm on my way.

163
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:03,960
Go.

164
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,480
Can you handle it alone?

165
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,760
You're here. How could you get lost?

166
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:21,040
Have some hot water.

167
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:22,480
Thanks.

168
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:36,000
Why are you in my room, Shen Jingmo?

169
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,320
Take a good look,

170
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,120
whose room is this?

171
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,200
Our Shen Family also owns properties in Binhai.

172
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,800
You even got the hotel wrong,

173
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:52,120
and your drinking capacity is so poor.

174
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:55,440
I remember I had already checked into the hotel.

175
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,240
Oh my,

176
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:02,400
I went to the wrong place.

177
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,400
I can't drink that much anymore.

178
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:06,840
No,

179
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:08,760
it's this way.

180
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,040
I stood at the door for too long.

181
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,960
The wind makes me dizzy.

182
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,800
Did I do anything embarrassing last night?

183
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:18,040
If I hadn't picked you up,

184
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:20,520
you'd still be sleeping on the street.

185
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,720
Who changed my clothes?

186
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,480
Not me.

187
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,920
You came back last night,

188
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:44,840
and kept asking to take off your clothes.

189
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,200
I asked the cleaner to help you.

190
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:47,520
Pajamas?

191
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,720
You really tricked me into thinking it was a dog.

192
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,200
I didn't.

193
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,200
Of course I didn't.

194
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,600
You're so conservative.

195
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:00,880
What time is it?

196
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:01,760
Huh?

197
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:02,360
What time is it now?

198
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:05,040
Half past ten.

199
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:07,200
Oh no, I'll miss my flight.

200
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:11,960
Thank you for last night.

201
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,320
I'll treat you to dinner when I get back to Lucheng.

202
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:28,200
Hello?

203
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:29,720
[Hello, Mr. Shen.]

204
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,360
[I found something interesting.]

205
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:32,640
[It's related to Miss Jiang.]

206
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,200
[I've sent it to your phone.]

207
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:01,040
What painting do you want to buy?

208
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,440
I want to see Ziman.

209
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:08,760
That's impossible.

210
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,560
Without her permission,

211
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:12,040
I can't do this.

212
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,440
Help!

213
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:20,080
Who are you?

214
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:20,680
Dad.

215
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,120
What do you want?

216
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:24,440
You still think

217
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:26,440
your daughter is studying abroad?

218
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:27,680
What do you mean?

219
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:30,320
The gambling debts she owes

220
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:32,440
can't be paid off even if you sell

221
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:33,560
the whole gallery.

222
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,720
That's impossible.

223
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:35,720
Ting

224
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:36,960
doesn't gamble.

225
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,760
Who knows?

226
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:42,040
Maybe she was taken to Las Vegas by a classmate

227
00:15:42,280 --> 00:15:43,600
and got set up.

228
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,320
It was your doing.

229
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:50,920
Let's make a deal.

230
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:53,400
Tell me who is Purple Vine.

231
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,480
I'll pay off

232
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,120
her gambling debts.
